    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Medical College's department of obstetrics and gynaecology, the children's hospital (AKUH) and the team of child development and rehabilitation centre marked the International Day of Persons with Disabilities to raise awareness about children with disabilities and their right to dignity and social inclusivity.",
